<p>Hi {{customerName}},</p>
<p>Thank you for your order. Your order has been placed successfully.</p>
<p><strong>Order Number:</strong> {{orderNumber}}</p>
<p><strong>Status:</strong> {{status}}</p>
<p><strong>Order Date:</strong> {{createdAt}}</p>

<table style='border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 600px;'>
  <thead>
    <tr>
      <th
        align='left'
        style='border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'
      >Product</th>
      <th
        align='left'
        style='border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'
      >Qty</th>
      <th
        align='left'
        style='border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;'
      >Price</th>
    </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    {{#each items}}
      <tr>
        <td
          style='padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;'
        >{{this.product.name}}</td>
        <td
          style='padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;'
        >{{this.quantity}}</td>
        <td
          style='padding: 8px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;'
        >${{this.totalPrice}}</td>
      </tr>
    {{/each}}
  </tbody>
</table>

<p style='margin-top: 16px;'><strong>Shipping Fee:</strong> ${{shippingFee}}</p>
<p><strong>Total Paid:</strong> ${{totalAmount}}</p>

<p>If you need any help, please contact our support team.</p>
<p>Thank you for shopping with us.</p>